        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 3:40AM HST until September 26 at 6:00PM HST by NWS Honolulu HI</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds to 30 knots. Seas 8 to 13 feet.

* WHERE...Kauai Northwest Waters, Kauai Windward Waters and
Kauai Leeward Waters.

* WHEN...Through Saturday afternoon.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in these conditions.</instruction>
